# IQX replay benchmark — frozen ground-truth dataset.
#
# Format: one JSON object per line (JSONL). Lines starting with '#' or
# blank lines are treated as comments and skipped by the loader.
#
# This is the v0.1 seed dataset. Hand-curated to:
#   - mirror the wire shape ``boss_smart_money`` emits in ``signal_data``;
#   - cover both ``verdict_was_alpha=true`` (price moved >= +3% in 4h)
#     and ``verdict_was_alpha=false`` (price did not) outcomes;
#   - use exactly 4 of each, so the always-skeptical baseline Worker
#     lands at exactly 4/8 (50.0%) — clean floor, maximum visible
#     headroom for a smarter Worker.
#
# Curators: keep this file deterministic. The shipped contract tests
# lock the per-record count and the baseline-accuracy fraction;
# changing either requires updating the corresponding test and is
# intentional, not incidental.
#
# Field reference: see iqx/bench/dataset.py.
